# The @ventora scope previously resolved from a private registry:
#
#   @ventora:registry=https://ventora-package-registry.REPLACE_WITH_WORKERS_DEV_SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev/
#   //ventora-package-registry.REPLACE_WITH_WORKERS_DEV_SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev/:_authToken=${VENTORA_REGISTRY_TOKEN}
#
# Those lines are commented out because `@ventora/ai-cs` now resolves to the
# local workspace package in packages/ai-cs-stub. Leaving them active made every
# pnpm command warn about the missing VENTORA_REGISTRY_TOKEN env var for anyone
# without registry credentials. See packages/ai-cs-stub/README.md.
